{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYDLESS is a fast-paced FPS built around momentum, skill, and a deadly bouncing ball, the more you punch it, the faster it gets\u2014turning it into a high-speed, projectile of destruction. It fuses together classic movement shooters with a unique bouncing ball weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.poster.avif?t=1758704558\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.webm?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.mp4?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality is breaking. Trapped in an anomaly, you are Diego, an employee of Randy\u2019s Burger, a  fast-food chain at the end of the \u201890s. But something is wrong. The restaurant keeps shifting, twisting into increasingly distorted versions of itself.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.poster.avif?t=1758704558\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.webm?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.mp4?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your agility and mastery of movement to navigate the chaos and avoid relentless attacks from the  customers, twisted by the shifting reality of the restaurant.Destroy them with your weapon a high-speed bouncing ball that gains more power the faster it moves. Punch it, control it and Turn every room into a deadly playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through four chapters, each unlocking new powers to push your abilities even further. Every level features a ranking system based on speed and skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.poster.avif?t=1758704558\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.webm?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master each stage, and push your skills to the limit as you fight to escape the loop\u2026 if escape is even possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.poster.avif?t=1758704558\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.webm?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.mp4?t=1758704558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524780?t=1758704558","background